**Items:** 10
**Blocking deps:** None (fully independent of bathos Python)
**Duration:** ~1 week (overlaps with Batch 3a)
**Worktree strategy:** Separate praxia worktree `~/projects/praxia/worktrees/v06-gate-error`. No bathos dependency; can begin as early as Batch 1.
**Phase exit gate:** `cargo nextest run -p praxia-core -E 'test(gate_error)'` passes; MCP error JSON contains `error_code` field with valid enum variant.

